.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-entitlements-update-subscription - Update subscription entitlements


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago entitlements update-subscription  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
This accepts a list of entitlements to update. If the feature isn't part of the subscription yet, it's added with all the privileges from the payload. If the feature is already part of the subscription (via plan or via override), the privilege and values are updated or added. All privileges must be valid for the feature. All features  and privileges not part of the payload are left untouched. To remove privileges or features, use the DELETE endpoints.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for update-subscription

.PP
\fB--input\fP=""
	Complete JSON request body or @file.json

.PP
\fB--subscription-status\fP=""
	Filter by subscription status. When provided, the subscription is looked up with this status instead of the default 'active' status. Possible values are 'pending', 'active', 'terminated', or 'canceled'.; one of: pending, active, terminated, canceled


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	Override the Lago API key

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	Override the Lago API URL

.PP
\fB--confirm\fP=""
	Confirm a dangerous operation with its resource identifier

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Print mutating requests without sending them

.PP
\fB--insecure\fP[=false]
	Allow insecure HTTP or TLS for self-hosted Lago

.PP
\fB--mode\fP=""
	Environment mode: live or test

.PP
\fB--no-retry\fP[=false]
	Disable automatic retries

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="table"
	Output format: table, json, or yaml

.PP
\fB--profile\fP=""
	Named profile to use

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath expression applied to the response

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30s
	Total request timeout

.PP
\fB--timing\fP[=false]
